# Currency Selector

A search-friendly combobox component for selecting international currencies, with support for localization and symbols.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/currency-selector.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/currency-selector.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/currency-selector.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { CurrencySelector } from '@/registry/currency-selector'

const currency = ref('USD')
</script>

<template>
  <CurrencySelector v-model="currency" lang="en-US" />
</template>
```

