### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `lang` | `string` | `'es-ES'` | BCP 47 language tag for currency localization. |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Disable the selector. |
| `config` | `Object` | `Default labels` | Custom labels for placeholder, search, and empty state. |
| `v-model` | `string` | `undefined` | The selected currency code (ISO 4217). |
